; The single coq.extraction of the project. Output goes to _build; the
; library directories under ../.. pull their own modules out of here with
; (copy_files (mode promote)).
;
; (extracted_modules) lists every module some library wants. The Stdlib
; residue extraction also writes here — BinInt, BinNums, PosDef, NatDef,
; Datatypes, Specif, and the innards of the Z operations — is deliberately
; absent: naming it nowhere is what keeps it out of the repository, and it
; is why ../PrimitiveExtraction.v does not bother realizing those modules
; down to empty.

(include_subdirs no)

(coq.extraction
 (prelude extract)
 (theories RocqBottom RocqBottomExtr Stdlib)
 (extracted_modules AbstractionCombination
                    Quadrivalent QuadrivalentOps
                    ZInterval ZIntervalAPI ZIntervalOps ; API
 ))
